Build 042 (from 041's measurements; the user asked for a stable 042):
- Descriptor queue payloads a quarter of the size (guest 0x80000 -> 0x20000 entries per frame,
  96 -> 24 MiB; compute 0x20000 -> 0x8000, 24 -> 6 MiB): a full slice waits for the worker
  (Acquire), as before. EDEN_DESCRIPTOR_PEAK gives each queue's largest frame.
- (headless/main.cpp) fiber stacks 512 KiB by default (041: deepest use 97 KiB; guard in 99zzzzu).
- (headless/crash_report.cpp) the crash report lists the last 1000 direct-memory events.

